\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Mkt Debt Flat; Turkey Stable On Early Vote Prospects   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Wailin Wong   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 577 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Mai 2007\par 22:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Emerging market bonds were confined to narrow ranges on Wednesday, with Turkish assets hanging onto the previous session's gains as the country geared up for potential early general elections.   \par \par \uc2 Spreads on  \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 's Emerging Markets Bond Index Plus were unchanged at 162 basis points over Treasurys, with lightly positive returns of 0.01%. Brazil's Global 2040, a benchmark for the asset class, dropped 1/8 to 135 13/16 bid, according to Reuters, while its EMBI+ spread was flat at 153 basis points over Treasurys.   \par \par \uc2 Turkey's Global 2030 fell 5/8 to 154 11/16 bid and its EMBI+ spread widened one basis point to 206 basis points over Treasurys. But returns were 0.06% on the day. A parliamentary committee approved Wednesday a proposal to hold general elections on July 22. The general assembly could approve the date as early as Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 Prime Minister Recep Tayyip Erdogan had called for early elections on June 24, but Turkey's electoral board proposed July 22 instead. Turkish markets rebounded Wednesday as investors saw early elections as a way to relieve tensions between the ruling moderate Islamist AK Party and the military-backed secularists.   \par \par \uc2 Turkey is facing an "intense situation," said George Estes of GMO, which has $5.5 billion in emerging market debt under management, but he's "not convinced that it will affect the economy or the credit."   \par \par \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  said Wednesday it has cut Turkey to marketweight in its EMBI Global model portfolio on "heightened political uncertainty." The investment house also downgraded Ukraine. On the EMBI Global, Ukraine's risk premium tightened four basis points to 155 basis points over Treasurys.   \par \par \uc2 Venezuela's Global 2027 tumbled 3/8 to 122 3/8 bid and its EMBI+ spread widened two basis points to 224 basis points over Treasurys. President Hugo Chavez has declared his intention to pull out of the International Monetary Fund. Analysts note, however, that Venezuela's sovereign bonds carry a convenant that characterizes withdrawal from the IMF as an event of default. Bear Stearns downgraded Venezuelan sovereign debt to underperform on Wednesday on these "technical default" concerns, but acknowledged that the practical implications are unclear because most Venezuelan bonds trade above par.   \par \par \uc2 Colombia's Global 2033 rose 1/4 to 148 3/4 bid and its EMBI+ spread tightened two basis points to 135 basis points over Treasurys. President Alvaro Uribe has called on his economic team and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow the peso's appreciation and curb speculative inflows. Given that inflation is rising in \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has limited ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to weaken the peso,  \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  noted Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 "This should then rekindle fears that the (government) could adopt other types of less market friendly measures to deal with (peso) strengthening," Goldman said.   \par \par \uc2 On the EMBI Global, the Dominican Republic tightened one basis point to 174 basis points over Treasurys. Moody's Investors Service upgraded the country's sovereign credit rating to B2 from B3 on Wednesday. The move brings Moody's in line with  \uc2 Standard & Poor's\uc2  and Fitch Ratings, both of which rate the Dominican Republic single-B - equivalent to Moody's B2.   \par \par \uc2 -By Wailin Wong, Dow Jones Newswires; 201 938 5240; wailin.wong@dowjones.com [ 02-05-07 2006GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1179 1810 4071   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070502e352000y7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
