\par\par \b \uc2 Colombia cenbank says sold gov't $700 mln in week  \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 2005\par 23:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BOGOTA, Colombia, Sept 23 (Reuters) - Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday it sold the government $700 million in international reserves during the week, part of its plan to help control the value of the local peso.  \par \par \uc2 The sales were part of a $3 billion program announced by the bank last week.  \par \par \uc2 Half of the purchase of reserves will be paid for by the government in cash while it raises the other half by selling peso denominated bonds, Colombia's Finance Ministry said earlier this week.  \par \par \uc2 The peso <COP=RR> has risen more than 10 percent against the dollar over the last 12 months, sparking howls from Colombian exporters who say their goods are losing competitiveness overseas.  \par \par \uc2 To the extent that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have more Treasury instruments on the asset side of its balance sheet, it can draw on them to absorb excess liquidity generated by its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's net international reserves rose to an all-time high of $15.681 billion as of Sept. 14.  \par \par \uc2 The bank did not provide a reason for the rise. But it has been regularly buying U.S. dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in its effort to keep the peso from strengthening.  \par \par \uc2 The government said last week it plans to maintain an aggressive dollar buying policy.  \par \par \uc2 The government has set a target with the International Monetary Fund of finishing the year with reserves of at least $12.2 billion. ($1=2,292 Colombian pesos)  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-COLOMBIA-RESERVES|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050923e19n0022d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
