\par\par \b \uc2 COP1.9T TES In  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  06 Budget For  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 2005\par 18:43\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--The Colombian government said Friday it has included a provision in its 2006 budget for issuance of 1.9 trillion pesos ($1=COP2,298.00) in local treasury issuance called TES that could be used for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and ultimately foreign debt repurchases.  \par \par \uc2 It all depends on whether the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps appreciating, Finance Minister Alberto Carrasquilla said in a press conference Friday.  \par \par \uc2 Carrasquilla said the government could increase TES issuance to COP28.8 trillion, of which COP1.9 trillion worth of TES notes could be sold in the primary market to raise pesos for purchase of dollars in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 "The government has included this COP1.9 trillion in next year's budget, in case we have to face a strong peso revaluation," he told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 The Colombian peso has appreciated 3.6% against the dollar so far this year, despite steady \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Last year, the peso gained more than 18%, even though the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  had spent $2.4 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's budget for 2006 remains unchanged at COP105.4 trillion, but budget items were modified to include the new COP1.9 trillion, Carrasquilla noted.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Diana Delgado, Dow Jones Newswires; 571-600-1980; colombia@dowjones.com   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Luis Enrique Hurtado contributed to this article.) [ 16-09-05 1643GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050916e19g000u0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
