nk on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 -By Diana Delgado, Dow Jones Newswires; 571-600-1980; colombia@dowjones.com [ 04-04-05 2210GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1068 1845  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050404e144000xi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
