\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Cenbank to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  Thursday to help peso. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Javier Mozzo and Nelson Bocanegra \par \uc2 497 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 August 2002\par 02:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , July 31 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Wednesday it would sell another $180 million in dollar-purchase options on Thursday, and relaxed restrictions on future \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to give itself more leeway to stem the peso's 13 percent slide against the dollar this year. \par \par \uc2  Although the peso broke its seven-day losing streak on Wednesday, clawing back 0.27 percent of its value to close at 2,638 per dollar, the bank said it had still broken a 4.0-percent limit for average depreciation over 20 days and had therefore triggered automatic \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the peso on Monday, in what was first \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since floating the peso in 1999. \par \par \uc2  The bank also said that, after Thursday, it was scrapping the $180 million limit on future \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  option auctions as well as a rule prohibiting it from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  again until all options are exercised. \par \par \uc2  The Colombian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been beset by nerves about the country's swelling swag of public debt, exacerbated by the regional financial crisis spreading northward from Argentina and Brazil. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has lost 9 percent of its value in July alone. \par \par \uc2  This poor performance compares to a \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  forecast of an 8 percent depreciation for all of 2002 and a loss of just 2.7 percent against the dollar last year. \par \par \uc2  The peso was helped on Wednesday by financial institutions' need to meet end-of-month positions. Also banks attend to the public for shorter hours on the last day of the month, giving the public less time to sell pesos. \par \par \uc2  Local banks on Wednesday exercised the last $63 million of $180 million in dollar-purchase options which the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold on Monday. The options gave holders the right to buy pesos at 2,596.26 until Aug. 28. \par \par \uc2  "Demand (for dollars) eased, but not because it isn't there," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday that the country's banking system had seen its stock of dollars fall by 50 percent since December to $200 million. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that risk-weary foreign banks have reduced the availability of loans to Colombian banks and companies - creating a scarcity of dollars that has also helped the peso's slide. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  General Manager Miguel Urrutia said on Friday there was no liquidity crisis or need for the government to raise foreign reserves, which now hovering near a record high with $10.81 billion, the bank said on Monday. The peso fell a slight 2.7 percent against the dollar in 2001. \par \par \uc2  The bank is forecasting that foreign reserves will total $10.48 billion at the end of 2002. \par \par \uc2  The war-torn Andean nation, fighting Marxist rebels for 38 years, ended 2001 with record high foreign reserves of $10.16 billion, surpassing an IMF-agreed minimum of $9.14 billion for the year. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020801dy81001e4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
