\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Cenbank drops peso  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  limit. \b0\par\par\uc2 219 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 August 2002\par 01:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , July 31 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it was giving itself more leeway to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the peso-dollar market and would drop a requirement limiting its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  option auctions to a fixed sum of $180 million. \par \par \uc2  The new guidelines covering \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to influence the peso will not come into force until after an auction scheduled for Thursday to support the embattled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will now be able to auction as many options as it likes. \par \par \uc2  In another move designed to allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to act more easily in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the Bank now says that it will no longer necessarily wait for all of its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  options already in the market to be exercised before auctioning fresh options. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said earlier on Wednesday that the peso had breached a 4 percent depreciation limit over 20 days, automatically triggering another $180 million auction set for Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Wednesday, local banks exercised the last $63 million of $180 million in dollar-purchase options which the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold on Monday, in what was its first \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since floating the peso in 1999. All the options had to be activated for further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to go ahead. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020731dy7v016rc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
