c2 's rising debt and Latin America's economic crisis, has lost 13 percent of its value this year, and almost 9 percent in July. This poor performance compares to a \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  forecast of an 8 percent depreciation for all of 2002 and a loss of just 2.7 percent against the dollar last year. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020731dy7v015oh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
