\par\par \b \uc2  Colombia Intraday Peso Recovering From S&P Blow - Traders \b0\par\par\uc2 323 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Mai 2000\par 19:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA -(Dow Jones)- Colombia's peso was at COP2153.00 to the dollar and strengthening mid-session Wednesday, but down 2.0% from Tuesday's record low close of COP2109.00, after Standard & Poor's added a blow of its own to a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  already sliding on political instablity concerns. \par \par \uc2  The rating agency cut Colombia's long-term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rating and senior unsecured debt ratings to BB from BB+ and maintained a negative outlook for both. \par \par \uc2  A trader said that, as banks took profits, the peso had recovered from a low point of COP2175.00 - a daily dip of 3.0% - which was just after the S&P announcement. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar had already risen to around COP2150 before the news, then it shot up and now it's come back again," a Bogota-based trader said. "The market is very very volatile." \par \par \uc2  Traders said that if the day's weighted average finishes the session above COP2136.84, it would trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , through an auction of dollar put options early Thursday. \par \par \uc2  If Wednesday's weighted average exchange rate - which forms the basis for the next day's benchmark representative market rate or TRM - is more than 5% above the moving 20-session average, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will, when the market opens Thursday, hold an auction of options to sell the institution $120 million. Those options could be exercised that day at the prevailing TRM. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rule was established in November to iron out excessive exchange rate volatility but hasn't been used yet. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokeswoman said the institution couldn't yet confirm that a TRM of at least COP2136.84 for Thursday would activate the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mechanism. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market closes at 1:00 p.m. local time (1800 GMT). \par \par \uc2  -Mary Morrison; Dow Jones Newswires; 571-619-0993; mary.morrison@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5o02l3p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
