\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Early Peso Down 1.5%, May Trigger  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 339 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Mai 2000\par 17:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA -(Dow Jones)-  Signs of deepening congressional dissent knocked \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso to COP2141.00 to the dollar in early trade Wednesday, 1.5% off Tuesday's close of COP2109.00, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Jaime Restrepo, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and derivatives manager at Banco Santander, said that if the day's weighted average finishes the session above 2136.84, it would trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  through an auction of dollar put options early Thursday. \par \par \uc2  He said the average so far was around COP2132 on unusually heavy early volume of around $40 million. \par \par \uc2  "It's because of the conversations in congress last night, which make it look like there won't be any kind of agreement behind the economic plans," Restrepo said. "The market's a bit nervous." \par \par \uc2  A group of Liberal legislators vowed late Tuesday to block the passage of key economic bills until a deal is reached with the Conservative government of President Andres Pastrana on controversial plans for a referendum on political reform. But the government has said that the referendum isn't open for negotiation with the Liberals, but will instead be authorized through the collection of millions of signatures. \par \par \uc2  If Wednesday's weighted average exchange rate - which forms the basis for the next day's benchmark representative market rate or TRM - is more than 5% above the moving 20-session average, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will, when the market opens Thursday, hold an auction of options to sell it $120 million. Those options could be exercised that day at the prevailing TRM. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rule was established in November to iron out excessive exchange rate volatility, but it hasn't been used yet. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokeswoman said the institution couldn't yet confirm that a TRM of at least COP2136.84 for Thursday would activate the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mechanism. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso has now fallen 4.9% in an eight-day slide, prompted mainly by\par political concerns.\par    -Mary Morrison, Dow Jones Newswires, 571-619-0993\par     mary.morrison@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5o02kwh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
