\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  Intraday Peso Down But Well Off  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Limit \b0\par\par\uc2 300 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Mai 2000\par 18:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA -(Dow Jones)-  \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso (COP) was at COP2116.00 to the dollar mid-session Tuesday, 0.7% weaker than Monday's close of COP2100.50, but well off the average daily level of COP2125.38 that would trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , market participants said. \par \par \uc2  A trader at a Colombian bank said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had stabilized from an early weak point of COP2120.00 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "There was heavy speculation earlier, but the market has calmed, so I don't think it'll get up to the limit today," she said. \par \par \uc2  She added that state oil company Ecopetrol was selling dollars, which helped to bring the exchange rate down. \par \par \uc2  But if the day's weighted average exchange rate - which forms the basis for tomorrow's benchmark representative market rate or TRM - did top COP2125.38, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would, after the market closes, hold an auction of options to sell it $120 million. The trader said those options could be exercised tomorrow at the prevailing TRM. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rule was established in November to iron out excessive exchange rate volatility but hasn't been used. It allows for auctions of dollar put or call options whenever the TRM diverts by at least 5% from its moving average over the previous 20 business days. \par \par \uc2  The peso has fallen 5.7% in the last month, knocked down mainly by political concerns. \par \par \uc2  The government hasn't yet managed to rebuild its shattered alliance with opposition Liberal legislators, which jeopardizes key economic reform proposals. \par \par \uc2  And fledgling peace talks with leftist guerrillas seem to be faltering, amid an apparent escalation of violence in the country's bloody 36-year civil conflict. \par \par \uc2  -Mary Morrison; Dow Jones Newswires; 571-619-0993; mary.morrison@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5n02lni\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
