\par\par \b \uc2  Colombia's New Floating Peso Regime: Dirty Or Clean? \b0\par\par\uc2  By David Koop \par \uc2 886 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 1999\par 03:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA (Dow Jones)--Colombia on Monday launched its new free-floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime with a promise to let market forces set the peso's value, but analysts doubt its \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will take a completely hands-off approach. \par \par \uc2  Traders and analysts said Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has still not clarified just how "clean" or "dirty" the exchange system will be, but early signs are that there will be a fair amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "In principle, they've said the market will be clean, but I think they're going to continue with dirty \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  when they deem it necessary," predicted Juan Fernando Reseo, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager with Banco Sudameris in Colombia. \par \par \uc2  In a "clean" floating system, the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is determined solely by market forces, while in a "dirty" system the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses various mechanisms to influence the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's value at given times, but not to keep it at a preset range or value against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced Saturday that it had scrapped its five-year-old crawling \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading band, which had obliged the bank to buy or sell dollars if needed to keep the peso within a preset range against the dollar. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the week before the decision to scrap the band, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par had been forced to spend $401 million of its reserves to defend the\par peso.\par      \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Says Peso To Be Set By Market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "From today on, the peso-dollar exchange rate will be determined by\par the market," \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Governor Miguel Urrutia said in a Saturday\par night news conference to announce the elimination of the band.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But he added that the bank "will \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if there are temporary or\par seasonal situations of excess supply or demand in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par market."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  then said it would auction $100 million in\par dollar-denominated TES bonds on Tuesday to boost the peso during the\par system's startup.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The auction of the bonds will reduce demand for dollars and represents\par an attempt by the bank to head off a possible initial plunge in the\par peso, according to analysts.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par It is not the only tool the bank has taken to head off a peso\par devaluation under the free-float system.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  two weeks ago cut the maximum size of banks' dollar\par spot holdings to 20% from 50% as a proportion of technical assets in a\par move to block speculation against the peso.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "This measure is still in place. It means financial institutions do\par not have the same capacity to buy dollars as before and it limits their\par ability to put pressure on the dollar," said Erica Montanez, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par analyst at Colombian brokerage Corredores Asociados.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I also think the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will continue to sell dollars from its\par reserves at given moments. Some of my sources told me the bank could\par have even been selling dollars surreptitiously" Monday to support the\par peso, she said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A spokeswoman at the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would not confirm whether the bank\par had sold any dollars.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The spokeswoman also said the degree of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  the bank will\par take in the market has still not been decided.\par    How Bank Will Influence Market Still Not Clear\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par This lack of definition of Colombia's peso policy worries some\par bankers.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "There remain many unanswered questions about what forms of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will\par adopt," Armando Montenegro, President of Colombia's National Association\par of Financial Institutions, wrote in a briefing.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Montenegro said it was urgent that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  define what\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  measures it will take and that these measures be\par "competitive, general and transparent."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A complete free-float in a small market like Colombia could generate\par instability, which is why most floats in Latin America are "dirty,"\par Montenegro wrote.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He cited Peru and Brazil as floating regimes with widespread "dirty"\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the central banks. In Brazil's case, he said the bank\par has influenced the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  through the sale of dollar-denominated\par bonds, similar to Colombia's TES bonds.\par      Peso Survives First Day Under New Regime\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso closed 1.1% weaker against the dollar in Monday's trading,\par easing fears of a large devaluation on the first day of the new \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par regime.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Some analysts have predicted an initial downward overshoot of the peso\par against the dollar, followed by a gradual recovery since the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is\par not overvalued.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso had lost about 30% of its value over the past 12 months.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Fortunately, the market was calm. This shows that there was no reason\par for an overreaction or macrodevaluation. This is a favorable piece of\par news and shows that the decision was made at the correct moment,"\par Finance Minister Juan Camilo Restrepo told reporters Monday in\par Washington, where he was meeting with officials from the Inernational\par Monetary Fund.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Restrepo wouldn't comment on whether the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will set aside\par funds to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the exchange market.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Colombia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was one of the few remaining countries with \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trading\par bands. Chile had been the most recent Latin American country to scrap\par its band, following in the footsteps of Brazil and Ecuador earlier this\par year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By David Koop; 571-215-7132; dkoop@apbogota.org.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 28-09-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0101GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1833 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9s0727h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
