not want to see a stronger crown," said the trader. \par \par \uc2  However, the effects of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  were hard to gauge, he said. \par \par \uc2  "The market might be a little nervous of long zloty, stemming the buy-zloty-regardless tendency," he said. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6s05itb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
