\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  mkt Thurs,Fri. \b0\par\par\uc2 395 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 17:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, March 23 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Tuesday it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets last Thursday and Friday to prevent the peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from rising amid recent wafer-thin volume. \par \par \uc2  Salomon Kalmanovitz, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  co-director, said in La Republica newspaper the bank was responsible for about half the turnover in last Thursday's session and for about one-third Friday - which would amount to about $30 million. \par \par \uc2  Volume in Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has been extremely thin lately in the wake of a controversial hike in a financial transactions tax. The paucity of trade has exagerrated even slight movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers consulted said the bank had purchased dollars on those days to maintain its depreciation rate on the peso. Colombia weakens its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  - this year the target is for a 17.1 percent depreciation - to offset the impact of huge dollar inflows on the peso. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is allowed to trade within very wide bands set daily by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In last week's trade, the peso was nowhere near the outer limits of the band, and the bank appeared to be defending the middle of the range, traders said. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, for instance, the peso closed at 1,548 to the dollar, while the daily band was a billowing 1,461 to 1,681. \par \par \uc2  Kalmanovitz said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly, but had carried out transactions through commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  "The (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  all too frequently because there is high exchange rate volatility. We made up half the volume in Thursday's trade and more than one-third Friday," Kalmanovitz said. \par \par \uc2  Overall volume in Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been low for more than two weeks since the Constitutional Court increased an emergency levy on financial transactions. \par \par \uc2  A preferential 0.00012 percent levy had been applied to interbank deals since last November, but the court ruling upped that rate to bring it into line with the 0.002 percent levy on all general bank transactions. \par \par \uc2  The peso opened Tuesday at 1,547 against the dollar, up 1.7 pesos compared to Friday's close. The market was closed Monday in observance of St. Joseph's Day. \par \par \uc2  ((Nelson Bocanegra, Bogota newsroom, 571 523 7877, bogota.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010909dv3n00tcv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
