\par\par \b \uc2  Colombia peso ends weaker but well off lows. \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1999\par 20:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, Jan 15 (Reuters) - Colombia's peso ended slightly weaker Friday, but well off its lows, after it nosedived on news Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had decided to let its battered real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade freely. \par \par \uc2  The peso, which closed just two pesos lower against the dollar on the day, ended the volatile session at 1,589. \par \par \uc2  But dealers on the local interbank, or \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, said it took about $100 million in dollar sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to lift the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  off its intraday low of 1,639.9. \par \par \uc2  The peso crashed to that level, its weakest ever, moments after word that Brazil's beleaguered monetary authorities had bowed to pressure to let the real float freely. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on its reported \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but dealers said they were thinly-veiled and handled through well-known financial intermediaries. \par \par \uc2  Coupled with dollar sales by the Treasury, an estimated $120 million in government funds came onto the market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They reported 219 trades for a total of $243.2 million and said the peso's session high was 1,581. \par \par \uc2  Monday was a public holiday in Colombia. But in the week's short trade it dropped 61 pesos, or 4 percent against the dollar, from its close at 1,528 on Jan. 8. \par \par \uc2  (( - Bogota newsroom, 571 523 7877, fax 571 610 7733, bogota.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1f06g6p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
