\par\par \b \uc2  CORRECTED - Colombia cenbank hikes seven-, 14-day repo rates. \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 September 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  In BOGOTA story headlined "Colombia \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hikes \par \par \uc2  seven- , 14-day repo rates" please read in first paragraph ... \par \par \uc2  lending rates to 40 percent Tuesday ... instead of ...lending \par \par \uc2  rates Tuesday (adds percent to which rates were raised ). \par \par \uc2  In sixth paragraph please read...set at 32.5 percent \par \par \uc2  Monday... instead of... set at 35.5 percent Monday (corrects \par \par \uc2  rate) \par \par \uc2  A corrected story follows. \par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, Sept 29 (Reuters) - Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its seven-and 14-day lending rates to 40 percent Tuesday, in another tightening of monetary policy aimed at shoring up the local peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  Both so-called repo rates had been fixed at 30 percent since September 22, when the bank cut the seven-day rate from 45.5 percent and the 14-day from 45 percent. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  lowered its key rates in mid-September, after ratcheting them up to historic highs earlier in the month to defend the peso's new exchange band. \par \par \uc2  But the peso has remained under pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  or interbank market, and tumbled to a new all-time low of 1,565 to the dollar last Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  That fall came amid what traders described as active \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and dollar sales from \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign reserves, to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's overnight lending rate was set at 32.5 percent (corrects rate) Monday, up from 30.05 percent Friday. \par \par \uc2  (( - Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944, fax 571 610 7733, bogota.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113du9t00xny\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
