\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Colombia \highlight\uc2  cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 August 1998\par 22:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOGOTA, Aug 31 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it sold $41.8 million on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or interbank market, Monday in a bid to support the local peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The sales were made when the peso slammed up against the lower or weak end of its daily exchange rate band, which was set at 1,442.84, the bank said. \par \par \uc2  The bank's dollar sales, coupled with the $51.6 million in U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  it sold Friday, means that it has siphoned off at least $93.4 million from Colombia's foreign reserves over the last two trading sessions. \par \par \uc2  Despite Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which the bank announced on its internet page on the worldwide web, the peso shed 1.45 pesos against the dollar to close at 1,442.84, the level set as the weak end of the exchange band. \par \par \uc2  That same weak end of the band, the level that triggers \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has been set at 1,443.32 for Tuesday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Colombia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Banking Association estimates the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which now has about $9 billion in reserves, has sold $1 billion in foreign reserves so far this year to prop up the peso. \par \par \uc2  Roughly $700 million of those sales were made in June, when the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  came under speculative attack in the run-up to runoff presidential elections on June 21. \par \par \uc2  (( - Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944, fax 571 610 7733, bogota.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8v01u7u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
